  "captureTitle": "Automatic capture",
  "captureSubtitle": "Payments that arrive by themselves from your notifications and messages",
  "captureAuto": "Record what is clear on its own",
  "captureAutoHelp": "When the account, category and amount are certain and it isn't a duplicate, it's recorded without asking. Everything else waits in Needs review.",
